    "## 5. Visualize the fits\n",
    "\n",
    "Each color is one patient. Dots are actual visits; 'x' markers are floor-censored visits —\n",
    "kept and modeled via Tobit-style MLE, not dropped. Lines are each patient's fitted decay curve."
   ]
  },
